{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Man-in-the-Middle Attack.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Man-in-the-Middle Attack.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"man in the middle attack man in the middle attack","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Man-in-the-Middle Attack.md","fileName":"Man-in-the-Middle Attack.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Man-in-the-Middle Attack","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-09 00:00\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Cloud Security Monitoring and Resilience]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Cloud Security Monitoring and Resilience","Encrypted Communication Channel","cloudcomputing_mit.epub","gameprogrammingalgorithmsandtechniques.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Man-in-the-Middle Attack.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Man-in-the-Middle Attack.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"man in the middle attack man in the middle attack","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Man-in-the-Middle Attack.md","fileName":"Man-in-the-Middle Attack.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Man-in-the-Middle Attack","heading":"Man-in-the-Middle Attack","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"A man-in-the-middle attack places an unauthorized party between communicating endpoints so that it can observe, relay, alter, or substitute information while each endpoint appears to be communicating with the other.\n\nAuthenticating endpoints and using an [[Encrypted Communication Channel]] reduce the opportunity for this attack. Integrity checks also help reveal modification, provided their trusted values cannot be replaced by the attacker.\n\nIn a networked game, interception can occur on a machine other than the one running the client, allowing packets to be read or modified beyond the reach of local cheat detection. Authentication and encryption are especially important for credentials and other account-sensitive traffic.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Cloud Security Monitoring and Resilience","Encrypted Communication Channel","cloudcomputing_mit.epub","gameprogrammingalgorithmsandtechniques.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Man-in-the-Middle Attack.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Man-in-the-Middle Attack.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"man in the middle attack man in the middle attack","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Man-in-the-Middle Attack.md","fileName":"Man-in-the-Middle Attack.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Man-in-the-Middle Attack","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[cloudcomputing_mit.epub]]\n[[gameprogrammingalgorithmsandtechniques.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Cloud Security Monitoring and Resilience","Encrypted Communication Channel","cloudcomputing_mit.epub","gameprogrammingalgorithmsandtechniques.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}